    "detailed_description": "Your boat crashed on the deserted tropical island, and you have to<br />\r\nescape from it. <br />\r\n <br />\r\nYou need to fix the boat and collect enough food and water.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSearch for coconuts, mangos, and eggs on the island, look under rocks<br />\r\nfor scorpions, look on the shore for crabs and clams. Collect firewood<br />\r\nto make fire. Fire gives you warmth. Also, you can cook and boil water<br />\r\non fire. Remember, you cannot drink ocean water, and raw water can<br />\r\nmake you sick; to make it safe, you have to boil it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOn the shore, you can find baskets, bottles, fishing lines, and<br />\r\nplanks. You need planks to fix your boat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMonitor your temperature. Heat and cold make you lose your<br />\r\nenergy. Sleeping helps restore your energy, but hunger or thirst will<br />\r\nmake you more tired while your sleeping. Fire gives your warms, going<br />\r\ninto water cools you down.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you like the idea of simple game mechanics, you may like this<br />\r\ngame. Try it!",
